PSTROS ARGV + TWiLight integration validation
=============================================

Static changes:
- kvm/VmSkel/src/nds_main.c accepts argv[1] when it ends in .jar.
- argv[1] is opened directly; filename is not guessed or hard-coded.
- non-ARGV launch path preserves the original recursive chooser.
- normal JVM exit in ARGV mode returns from main instead of entering the chooser.

TWiLight add-on:
- config.jar.ini uses ARG=%PATH%.
- BANNER_PATH points to pstros_java.png.
- pstros_java.png validated at 32x32 and 15 visible colors.

Compilation status:
- NOT compiled in this environment because devkitPro/devkitARM and ndstool are not installed.
- Source-level patch and TWiLight configuration have been generated for build/testing on the normal devkitPro environment.
